    imageTexture: {fileID: 2800000, guid: ae1936b1643e08f439510b788a7c305b, type: 3}
    title: NPC
    description: Walk up to a character until the interact button appears on your
      screen. Tap it to start a conversation
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    imageTexture: {fileID: 2800000, guid: e7abccf7f8c81aa4983dc1fd5a1c41da, type: 3}
    title: 'Interacting with Objects '
    description: Walk close to any glowing object in the world. When the interact
      button appears, tap it. Different objects do different things tablets give
      you missions or lessons, crystals can be restored once the area is cleared.
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    imageTexture: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 6607da8ce750b674cb27754be6223463, type: 3}
    title: 'Interacting with Objects '
    description: These are tablet quests that need clearing for each sanctum, clear
      these to get one step closer in unlocking the boss
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    imageTexture: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 4853e70ec55a91b448731c0d94529591, type: 3}
    title: 'Puzzle: Pair a Code '
    description: A code snippet is shown with one line replaced by a question mark.
      Drag the correct line from the options on the right and drop it into the blank
      slot on the left.
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    imageTexture: {fileID: 2800000, guid: e069d2272a062b44b9331496c3b74caa, type: 3}
    title: 'Puzzle: True or False '
    description: A short block of Python code appears on screen. Decide whether the
      code is correct or contains a bug. Tap True if the code looks right, or False
      if you spot a problem.
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    imageTexture: {fileID: 2800000, guid: fa48b9673595b9c4fbd2b5d3bde95896, type: 3}
    title: 'Puzzle: Line Scramble '
    description: The lines of a program are shown in the wrong order. Drag and drop
      them to rearrange them into the correct sequence. When you are ready, tap Check.
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    imageTexture: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 11598656d05c1c14d8a3c1870a7049bb, type: 3}
    title: 'Puzzle: Spot the Bug '
    description: Several lines of code are listed. Tap the line you think contains
      the bug. A set of fix options then appears. Tap the version of that line that
      corrects the error.
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    imageTexture: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 79d990f0387bbc7469c7b87c42b4c1d7, type: 3}
    title: 'Puzzle: Predict the Output '
    description: A block of code is shown. Three possible outputs appear as draggable
      cards. Drag the one that matches what the code would actually print and drop
      it into the answer slot.
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    imageTexture: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 0764df58e56ad1746bd89196572052c2, type: 3}
    title: 'Puzzle: Fill in the Blank '
    description: A line of code is shown with one word missing, replaced by a blank.
      Four keyword options appear beside it. Tap the one that correctly completes
      the line.
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    imageTexture: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 2dd94f8adeffd314a8cbb9a1d2066d3b, type: 3}
    title: 'Repairing the Crystal '
    description: After the boss is defeated, a broken Rune Crystal appears in the
      area. Walk up to it and interact with it. The crystal restores, the corruption
      in the area clears, and the sanctum is marked complete. This also triggers
      the farewell dialogue from your guide NPC.
  - image: {fileID: 0}
    imageTexture: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 1a491ec8cb5c1ca449ef4ee2def9b6d3, type: 3}
    title: 'Follow the Compass '
    description: A compass arrow appears on your HUD pointing toward your next objective.
      Follow it when you are unsure where to go. It updates automatically as you
      complete steps.
  pageImage: {fileID: 145485148}
  pageTitleText: {fileID: 1089563913}
  pageDescriptionText: {fileID: 2047277704}
  pageCounterText: {fileID: 135709156}
  previousButton: {fileID: 2064857827}
  nextButton: {fileID: 1733759936}
  skipTutorialButton: {fileID: 1376322620}
  wrapAroundPages: 0
  pageCounterFormat: '{0} / {1}'
  skipButtonText: Skip
  tutorialBanner: {fileID: 0}
  tutorialBannerMessage: New here? Take a quick look at how the game works - or skip
    ahead and start playing!
